-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-ascii-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:13.0pt;color:#4c4c4c;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0pt;font-size:13.0pt;color:#4c4c4c;\">생을 대상으로 </span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">취</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-ascii-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">창업 지원을 위한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0pt;font-size:13.0pt;color:#4c4c4c;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-hansi-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-ascii-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">2019 IP-R&amp;D </span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">여름방학 캠프</span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-hansi-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:1.0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:13.0pt;color:#2d51ad;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family:경기천년제목 Light;mso-fareast-font-family:경기천년제목 Light;letter-spacing:1.0p